  "sourceTitle": "Large Chocolate Chip Cookie",
  "sourceText": "Large Chocolate Chip Cookie\nBy: Karlyn Oyama\nPublished: Tuesday, December 15, 2009 - 8:51pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 box yellow cake mix\n1/2 cup Oil\n2 tablespoons Water\n2 Eggs, beaten\n1 cup Chocolate chips\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine ingredients and stir until moistened. Place on a lightly greased pizza pan. Bake at 350 degrees for 20–25 minutes or until brown.",
